<title>FRANCE: FRANCE STOCKS.</title>
<headline>FRANCE STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares pushed higher in the late afternoon, heartened by firmness on Wall Street and high tech stocks, traders said. The dollar set a new 7-1/2 year high against the mark.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index up 11.56, or 0.38 percent,  at 3,037.50 at 1417 GMT.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 July futures 3,038 vs 3,028 at Fridays close.</p>
<p>Total volume was 6.2 billion francs.</p>
